{"sha": "9faf750f5795be87c8d371ec5be3f4b42d79b0dcc5dc0d04cee7d940876f137a", "body": ["{\\small 点电荷的场线：从 $+$ 径向射出，射入 $-$；", "靠近电荷处场线密集，描绘了场强按 $1/d^2$ 增大的情形。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{电容器的匀强电场}", "", "\\begin{definition}[平行板电容器]\\label{def:g11:electric-gravitational-fields:capacitor}", "两块正对、平行的金属板，相互靠近，带有", "异号电荷，构成\\emph{电容器}\\index{电容器}。两板之间", "的电场为\\emph{匀强电场}\\index{匀强电场}：大小和", "方向处处相同 --- 与极板垂直，由正极板指向", "负极板。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[两板间的电场]\\label{prop:g11:electric-gravitational-fields:uniform}", "若两板间的电压（\\cref{ch:g11:circuits-and-power}）为", "$U$，两板间距为 $d$，则两板间电场的大小为", "\\[", "E = \\frac{U}{d} \\qquad \\text{(单位 \\unit{V/m})}.", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{remark}", "匀强性与 $E = U/d$ 在本科一年级分册中予以严格推导；", "此式解释了单位 \\unit{V/m}。间隙很窄时，电场很强：", "一毫米间隙上加 \\qty{100}{V} 的电压，场强已达 \\qty{e5}{V/m}。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{example}[电子束的偏转]\\label{ex:g11:electric-gravitational-fields:beam}", "在示波器中，电子束穿过极板，两板间", "电压为 $U = \\qty{100}{V}$，间距为 $d = \\qty{5.0}{mm}$：", "$E = 100 / \\num{5.0e-3} = \\qty{2.0e4}{V/m}$，每个电子受到", "$F = \\num{1.60e-19} \\times \\num{2.0e4} = \\qty{3.2e-15}{N}$ 的力，方向指向", "正极板 --- 是电子重力 \\qty{8.9e-30}{N} 的 $\\num{4e14}$ 倍，", "因此电子束会明显偏转（曲线轨迹", "属于\\cref{ch:g12:newtons-laws}的内容）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.9]", "  \\draw[omDef, very thick] (0,2.2) -- (5.2,2.2)", "    node[right, font=\\small] {$+$};", "  \\draw[omProp, very thick] (0,0) -- (5.2,0)", "    node[right, font=\\small] {$-$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm] (0.8,2.05) -- (0.8,0.15);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm] (1.8,2.05) -- (1.8,0.15);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm] (2.8,2.05) -- (2.8,0.15)", "    node[pos=0.25, right, font=\\small] {$\\vect E$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm] (4.6,2.05) -- (4.6,0.15);", "  \\fill[omDef] (3.7,1.4) circle (2.5pt)", "    node[right=2pt, font=\\small] {$q>0$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omMeth, very thick] (3.7,1.4) -- (3.7,0.6)", "    node[left, font=\\small] {$q\\vect E$};", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth, thin] (-0.35,0) -- (-0.35,2.2)", "    node[midway, left, font=\\small] {$d$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 电容器的匀强电场：平行、等间距的", "场线，由 $+$ 极板指向 $-$ 极板，$E = U/d$；正电荷", "沿场方向受力，负电荷则逆场方向受力。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{引力场}", "", "\\begin{definition}[引力场]\\label{def:g11:electric-gravitational-fields:gfield}", "若将检验质量 $m$ 置于某点，它所受的万有引力（即", "重力）$\\vect P$，则该处的\\emph{引力场}\\index{引力场}", "为", "\\[", "\\vect g = \\frac{\\vect P}{m} \\qquad \\text{(单位 \\unit{N/kg})},", "\\]", "反之亦然，$\\vect P = m \\vect g$。前一章已引入", "数值 $g$；$\\vect g$ 则增加了下落石块开始运动的方向。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[地球的引力场]\\label{prop:g11:electric-gravitational-fields:earth}", "在距地心为 $d$ 处（地球质量为 $M$），", "引力场指向地心，大小为", "\\[", "g = G\\,\\frac{M}{d^2},", "\\qquad G = \\qty{6.67e-11}{N.m^2/kg^2}.", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由万有引力（\\cref{ch:g10:universal-gravitation}）可得", "检验质量 $m$ 所受的力：大小为 $G M m / d^2$，方向指向中心；", "两边除以 $m$。在地表处 $d = R$，此即", "前一章中的 $g = GM/R^2 \\approx \\qty{9.81}{N/kg}$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[月球所在处的引力场]\\label{ex:g11:electric-gravitational-fields:moon}", "在月地距离 $d = \\qty{3.84e8}{m}$ 处：", "\\[", "g = \\num{6.67e-11} \\times \\num{5.97e24} / (\\num{3.84e8})^2", "\\approx \\qty{2.7e-3}{N/kg}.", "\\]", "地球的引力场永不消失，只是按 $1/d^2$ 减弱；这正是", "使月球保持在轨道上运行的引力场。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{remark}[近地表的匀强性]\\label{rem:g11:electric-gravitational-fields:uniformg}", "在实验室乃至山地的尺度上，$d$ 与", "$R = \\qty{6.37e6}{m}$ 相比几乎不变，因此 $\\vect g$ 在很高精度下是匀强的：", "竖直的场线，大小恒为 \\qty{9.81}{N/kg} --- 地球的引力场看起来", "与电容器的电场相似，正如站在花园里看地球，它也显得是平的。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.9]", "  \\fill[omExo!15] (0,0) circle (0.85);", "  \\draw[omExo, thick] (0,0) circle (0.85);", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (0,0) {地球};", "  \\foreach \\a in {0,60,...,300}", "    \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (\\a:2.1) -- (\\a:0.95);", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small] at (30:1.9) {$\\vect g$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}